&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;zmeluu&quot; data-start=&quot;28&quot; data-end=&quot;46&quot;&gt;About the Role&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;48&quot; data-end=&quot;430&quot;&gt;We are looking for a Procurement Mid Analyst to support procurement operations and supplier management activities in a dynamic and fast-paced environment. This professional will play a key role in managing procurement processes end-to-end, ensuring contract compliance, purchase order accuracy, supplier engagement, and operational efficiency across multiple stakeholders and teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;432&quot; data-end=&quot;602&quot;&gt;The ideal candidate is organized, proactive, detail-oriented, and comfortable handling multiple priorities while collaborating with internal teams and external suppliers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;164ueu3&quot; data-start=&quot;604&quot; data-end=&quot;628&quot;&gt;Key Responsibilities&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;630&quot; data-end=&quot;1846&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;9ky4qk&quot; data-start=&quot;630&quot; data-end=&quot;737&quot;&gt;Manage procurement purchase contracts with key suppliers, ensuring compliance and operational continuity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1u6viet&quot; data-start=&quot;738&quot; data-end=&quot;887&quot;&gt;Maintain supplier documentation updated across internal systems and tools, including compliance and mandatory records required for PR/PO processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1bhuv7m&quot; data-start=&quot;888&quot; data-end=&quot;972&quot;&gt;Execute daily procurement operations and support end-to-end purchasing activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1aax1eq&quot; data-start=&quot;973&quot; data-end=&quot;1085&quot;&gt;Receive and review procurement requests, ensuring alignment with internal policies and operational procedures.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ipb6iu&quot; data-start=&quot;1086&quot; data-end=&quot;1178&quot;&gt;Convert Purchase Requisitions (PRs) into Purchase Orders (POs) accurately and efficiently.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ubd2x3&quot; data-start=&quot;1179&quot; data-end=&quot;1317&quot;&gt;Review and validate PO information, including supplier data, ship-to locations, pricing, quantities, and relevant comments/requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;qgtn9a&quot; data-start=&quot;1318&quot; data-end=&quot;1404&quot;&gt;Ensure supplier acknowledgement of purchase orders and monitor delivery commitments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1xmo3zd&quot; data-start=&quot;1405&quot; data-end=&quot;1524&quot;&gt;Manage PO updates, cancellations, rescheduling requests, and changes related to quantities, pricing, or requirements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1lqnb0g&quot; data-start=&quot;1525&quot; data-end=&quot;1618&quot;&gt;Follow up on purchase orders and support expediting activities to ensure timely deliveries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;8von2t&quot; data-start=&quot;1619&quot; data-end=&quot;1729&quot;&gt;Act as a point of contact for supplier-related issues, supporting dispute management and problem resolution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;a36wbs&quot; data-start=&quot;1730&quot; data-end=&quot;1846&quot;&gt;Collaborate closely with cross-functional teams to ensure smooth procurement operations and stakeholder alignment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;14esvje&quot; data-start=&quot;1848&quot; data-end=&quot;1864&quot;&gt;Requirements&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;1866&quot; data-end=&quot;2401&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;k01a9n&quot; data-start=&quot;1866&quot; data-end=&quot;1943&quot;&gt;Previous experience in Procurement, Purchasing, or Supply Chain operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1r5ocbr&quot; data-start=&quot;1944&quot; data-end=&quot;2007&quot;&gt;Experience with contract negotiation and supplier management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;ft9u34&quot; data-start=&quot;2008&quot; data-end=&quot;2060&quot;&gt;Advanced English proficiency (written and verbal).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1kifg0b&quot; data-start=&quot;2061&quot; data-end=&quot;2164&quot;&gt;Strong organizational skills with the ability to manage multiple demands in a fast-paced environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1dq7jc&quot; data-start=&quot;2165&quot; data-end=&quot;2225&quot;&gt;Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1ogwylt&quot; data-start=&quot;2226&quot; data-end=&quot;2281&quot;&gt;Proactive mindset, curiosity, and sense of ownership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1bmevjb&quot; data-start=&quot;2282&quot; data-end=&quot;2349&quot;&gt;Advanced knowledge of Microsoft Office package, especially Excel.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1jtddcd&quot; data-start=&quot;2350&quot; data-end=&quot;2401&quot;&gt;Previous experience with SAP is highly preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 data-section-id=&quot;gxq2rq&quot; data-start=&quot;2403&quot; data-end=&quot;2419&quot;&gt;Nice to Have&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul data-start=&quot;2421&quot; data-end=&quot;2633&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot; data-is-only-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;gpvilj&quot; data-start=&quot;2421&quot; data-end=&quot;2483&quot;&gt;Experience working in multinational or matrix organizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;vf5m35&quot; data-start=&quot;2484&quot; data-end=&quot;2551&quot;&gt;Familiarity with procurement compliance and operational controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-section-id=&quot;1dw2bj0&quot; data-start=&quot;2552&quot; data-end=&quot;2633&quot; data-is-last-node=&quot;&quot;&gt;Experience handling high-volume procurement routines and operational workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/section&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EBANX offers:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Performance Bonus: &lt;/strong&gt;Annual bonus program based on company results.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Meal Allowance: &lt;/strong&gt;Monthly allowance to support your meals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EBANX Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Financial assistance for undergraduate, graduate, and MBA programs to support your professional growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;EBANX Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Dedicated budget for courses, certifications, and workshops to encourage continuous learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Language Classes:&lt;/strong&gt; Language classes to support your personal and professional development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Health &amp;amp; Well-being: &lt;/strong&gt;Medical and dental plans with extensive coverage, including support for dependents and wellness programs.&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexible Work Culture:&lt;/strong&gt; Semi-flexible hours, additional day off on your birthday, and year-end break to support work-life balance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Well-being Program: &lt;/strong&gt;Access to activities and resources that promote physical and mental health.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Learn more about our &lt;strong&gt;#ebanxlife&lt;/strong&gt; on&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/ebanx/mycompany/?viewAsMember=true&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/ebanxlife/&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;, and see what it’s like to be part of a global team that breaks barriers, creates opportunities, and celebrates every achievement together.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;✨ An &lt;strong&gt;Out Of The Ordinary&lt;/strong&gt; career is waiting for you here!&lt;/p&gt;

adventinternational-zenoti:greenhouse:75.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Zenoti provides an all-in-one, cloud-based software solution for the beauty and wellness industry. Our solution allows users to seamlessly manage every aspect of the business in a comprehensive mobile solution: online appointment bookings, POS, CRM, employee management, inventory management, built-in marketing programs and more. Zenoti helps clients streamline their systems and reduce costs, while simultaneously improving customer retention and spending. Our platform is engineered for reliability and scale and harnesses the power of enterprise-level technology for businesses of all sizes&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Zenoti powers more than 30,000 salons, spas, medspas and fitness studios in over 50 countries. This includes a vast portfolio of global brands, such as European Wax Center, Hand &amp;amp; Stone, Massage Heights, Rush Hair &amp;amp; Beauty, Sono Bello, Profile by Sanford, Hair Cuttery, CorePower Yoga and TONI&amp;amp;GUY.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our recent accomplishments include surpassing a $1 billion unicorn valuation, being named Next Tech Titan by GeekWire, raising an $80 million investment from TPG, ranking as the 316th fastest-growing company in North America on Deloitte’s 2020 Technology Fast 500™. We are also proud to be recognized as a Great Place to Work CertifiedTM for 2021-2022 as this reaffirms our commitment to empowering people to feel good and find their greatness. To learn more about Zenoti visit: https://www.zenoti.com&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What will I be doing?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Processing Payment metrics (decline rates,&amp;nbsp;processing,&amp;nbsp;payouts, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively communicating on Production issues to customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handling Disputes and consulting with merchants when they need help managing their disputes or trends&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tracking Operational task efficiency (onboarding merchants, device logistics and support, working with partners to hold them accountable for SLAs, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifying and executing opportunities to automate or outsource activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnering with product engineering to ensure the product and features are operable by design&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partnering with Processors to resolve high priority Operation issues.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Representing the platform in customer discussions and handle escalated accounts due to operational issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Driving RCA and other feedback and data analysis to learn from current and improve the future&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Skills do I need?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to handle escalations and resolve issues quickly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in Payments domain is highly desirable.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5-8&amp;nbsp;years&amp;nbsp;of&amp;nbsp;experience in managing payment/acquiring operations for a payment processor, banks, or other financial institutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Exposure to global payments landscape is preferred.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong Communication Skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Self-motivation and goal-orientation, desire to deliver results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to work with multiple teams to achieve results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manage end-to-end US payroll processing activities, ensuring timely and accurate payroll execution.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle payroll compliance activities including federal/state tax regulations, deductions, filings, and audit support.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate with internal teams and external vendors to resolve payroll discrepancies and ensure compliance with US payroll policies and regulations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ready to work in Shifts across different time zones.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Why Zenoti?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-IN&quot;&gt;Be part of an innovative company that is revolutionizing the wellness and beauty industry.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-IN&quot;&gt;Work with a dynamic and diverse team that values collaboration, creativity, and growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-IN&quot;&gt;Opportunity to lead impactful projects and help shape the global success of Zenoti’s platform.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-IN&quot;&gt;Attractive compensation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;en-US&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Zenoti provides equal employment opportunities to all employees and applicants for employment and prohibits discrimination and harassment of any type without regard to race, color, religion, age, sex, national origin, disability status, genetics, protected veteran status, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state, or local laws.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt; &lt;/em&gt;&lt;em&gt;This policy applies to all terms and conditions of employment, including recruiting, hiring, placement, promotion, termination, layoff, recall, transfer, leaves of absence, compensation and training.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

alphapartners-coupang:greenhouse:7916663.descriptionHtml:
&lt;p&gt;Coupang is reimagining the shopping experience with the goal of wowing each customer from the instant they open the Coupang app to the moment an order is delivered to their door.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our services in Taiwan include “Rocket Delivery” which offers next-day delivery for a wide selection of items at affordable prices, “Rocket Overseas” which offers free international delivery on millions of best-selling products from Korea, the U.S., and beyond.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for talents to help us lead Coupang’s expansion in Taiwan. This is an exceptional opportunity to become a part of Coupang’s growth in Taiwan and create a world where our customers wonder, “How did I ever live without Coupang?”&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position : Senior Manager, Sourcing &amp;amp; Product Strategy （Direct Factory）&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Sourcing &amp;amp; Product Strategy Manager&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;acts as the bridge between market intelligence and manufacturing. Instead of just managing &quot;supply,&quot; you will use data to decide&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;what&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;to build and&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;em&gt;when&lt;/em&gt;to launch it. You will analyze e-commerce trends, competitor gaps, and consumer behavior in Taiwan to direct local factories to produce high-margin, high-demand products that will Wow the customers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do:&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data-Driven Assortment Planning:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Analyze platform sales data to identify &quot;white space&quot; opportunities for new product launches at better profitability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Launch Decisions:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Own the &quot;Go/No-Go&quot; decision for new products. Use pre-launch testing, A/B testing on landing pages, and competitive pricing analysis to validate a product’s potential before committing to factory MOQs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Direct Factory Partnerships:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Identify Taiwan-based manufacturers capable of &quot;Agile Production&quot;—factories that can handle smaller initial test batches and scale quickly based on real-time sales performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Negotiation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Focus negotiations on speed-to-market and re-order&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;flexibility rather than just unit cost. Secure terms that allow for &quot;just-in-time&quot; inventory to minimize overstock risk &amp;amp; ensure consistent availability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Lifecycle Management:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Monitor post-launch performance metrics (Conversion Rate, Return Rate, ROAS) to decide whether to double down on a factory line, iterate the design, or exit the category.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Competitor Benchmarking:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Regularly scrape and analyze competitor pricing and reviews to ensure our direct-to-factory products maintain a superior value proposition.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Essential Qualifications:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;E-commerce Savvy:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Deep understanding of the Taiwan e-commerce ecosystem, including seasonal spikes and local consumer purchasing triggers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Factory &amp;amp; Product understanding&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;: Deep understanding of the product categories and factories that can deliver products at best quality &amp;amp; lowest cost.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Acumen:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Strong ability to build business cases for new products, including projected ROI, Landed Cost Analysis, and Break-even points.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Relationship Management:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Ability to pitch &quot;growth stories&quot; to factory owners, convincing them to prioritize our production runs based on data-backed demand forecasts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;Apple-converted-space&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;5–7 years in Category Management, Growth Marketing, or Data-Driven Sourcing within an e-commerce/retail environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Recruitment Process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Application Review - Phone Interview - Onsite (or Virtual Onsite) Interview – Offer&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The exact nature of the recruitment process may vary according to the specific job and may be changed due to scheduling or other circumstances.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interview schedules and the results will be informed to the applicant via the e-mail address submitted at the application stage.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Things to Consider&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;This job posting may be closed prior to the stated end date for application if all openings are filled.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coupang has the right to rescind an offer of employment if a candidate is found to have submitted false information as part of the application process.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coupang does not discriminate against disabled applicants or those with veteran status. We are proud to offer equal opportunities for all applicants.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Privacy Notice&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Your personal information will be collected and managed by Coupang as stated in the Application Privacy Notice located below:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.coupang.jobs/privacy-policy/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://www.coupang.jobs/privacy-policy/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

