&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Pay &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Our compensation reflects the cost of living across several US geographic markets. At Coupang, your base pay is one part of your total compensation.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;The base pay for this position ranges from $155,000/year to $267,000/year.. Pay is based on several factors including market location and may vary depending on job-related knowledge, skills, and experience.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;strong&gt;General Description of All Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Medical/Dental/Vision/Life, AD&amp;amp;D insurance&lt;/div&gt;
