&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Intellectual Curiosity:&lt;/strong&gt; You are the type of person who dives down a &quot;rabbit hole&quot; to understand a new technology or find a hard-to-trace candidate. You have a high &quot;Need for Cognition.&quot;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Market Hunger:&lt;/strong&gt; You don’t just want to fill a role; you want to dominate the market segment. You are competitive, resilient, and thrive on the &quot;win&quot; of engaging a passive candidate who wasn&#39;t looking.&lt;/li&gt;
