&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Clinical Manager &lt;/strong&gt;– Pediatrics in Tinton Falls, NJ&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Salary&lt;/strong&gt;: $90,000-$95,000 per year, plus a $5,000 sign-on bonus payable after one year of employment.&lt;br&gt;PTO, comprehensive benefits, 401k match&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About BAYADA &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;Join &lt;strong&gt;BAYADA Home Health Care&lt;/strong&gt;, a nonprofit organization dedicated to compassion, excellence, and reliability. Our Skilled Nursing office provides high-acuity care for adult and pediatric clients who require complex, continuous, technology-dependent support. &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Clinical Manager – Pediatrics,&lt;/strong&gt; you’ll lead a team of nurses, ensuring safe, high-quality care, supporting professional growth, and building strong relationships with clients, families, and staff.&amp;nbsp;This office provides best in class care throughout Monmouth County. &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and mentor a team of nurses and support staff. &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee clinical care for pediatric clients, including assessments, care plans, and care coordination. &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure compliance with BAYADA policies, documentation standards, and state/federal regulations. &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with families, physicians, and the office team to deliver safe, personalized care. &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participate in quality improvement initiatives and problem-solving for complex care scenarios. &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Model The BAYADA Way, creating a respectful, inclusive, and supportive environment. &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You Bring &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;Required: &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Current RN license in New Jersey&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with adult OR pediatric populations; willingness to cross-train. &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leadership experience (preceptor, charge nurse, or supervisor). &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort with technology-dependent care (ventilators, tracheostomy, feeding tubes). &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Schedule &amp;amp; Work Environment &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Full-time role: exempt &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monday–Friday, daytime office hours 8:30am- 5:00pm&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Occasional travel for site visits, meetings, and community engagement &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Participation in the on-call rotation as needed; phone support only.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You’ll Love BAYADA &amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead a high-acuity, mission-driven practice serving pediatrics &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Join a small, supportive, values-based team in a nonprofit organization &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Access ongoing education, mentorship, and professional development &amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
