&lt;li&gt;Maintaining an accurate and current pipeline of opportunities within the CRM system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel up to 25%&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will bring to our team: &lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;We look for people who value agility, passion and teamwork; those who can bring fresh ideas to the table and want the opportunity to learn, grow, and expand their careers. Bring your aptitude and build upon what you do best for our customers, partners, team, and you.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Other qualities that will make you a fit for this role include:&lt;/p&gt;
