&lt;li&gt;3+ years previous partner management experience in the SaaS hemisphere&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;2+ years’ previous experience in the Microsoft partner eco-system&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BA/BS in Business, Marketing, Communications, or similar relevant field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong communication skills to articulate company vision, product changes, and adapting to new strategies&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to execute in an environment where priorities change quickly, demonstrating agility, adaptability, and problem-solving skills&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Entrepreneurial mindset and detail-oriented&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
